[00:00.00][by:黑枣先生]
[00:31.53]I could never find the right way to tell you
[00:31.53]我一直无法找到合适的方式告诉你
[00:36.65]Have you noticed I've been gone?
[00:36.65]你察觉到我的离开了吗？
[00:41.60]'Cause I left behind the home that you made me
[00:41.60]是你让我独立起来
[00:46.81]But I will carry it along
[00:46.81]我会一直坚持下去的
[00:50.45]And it's a long way forward, so trust in me
[00:50.45]漫漫长路就把信任交给我吧
[00:56.77]I'll give them shelter, like you've done for me
[00:56.77]我会建造一座坚固堡垒就像你为我做的那样
[01:01.34]And I know, I'm not alone, you'll be watching over us
[01:01.34]我知道我永远不是孤身一人，你会一直注视着我们
[01:07.60]Until you're gone
[01:07.60]直到你离我而去
[01:09.43]
[01:53.93]When I'm older, I'll be silent beside you
[01:53.93]当你老去我也会在你身旁默默守候
[01:59.16]I know words won't be enough
[01:59.16]我知道言语也无法表达这份情谊
[02:03.76]And they won't need to know our names or our faces
[02:03.76]他们不需要知道我们的名姓与长相
[02:09.13]But they will carry on for us
[02:09.13]也会在背后给我们支持
[02:12.67]And it's a long way forward, so trust in me
[02:12.67]漫漫长路就把信任交给我吧
[02:18.91]I'll give them shelter, like you've done for me
[02:18.91]我会建造一座坚固堡垒就像你为我做的那样
[02:23.06]And I know, I'm not alone, you'll be watching over us
[02:23.06]我知道我永远不是孤身一人，你会一直注视着我们
[02:29.65]Until you're gone
[02:29.65]直到你离我而去
[02:31.87]
[03:44.16]I could never find the right way to tell you
[03:44.16]我一直无法找到合适的方式告诉你
[03:49.90]Have you noticed I've been gone?
[03:49.90]你察觉到我的离开了吗？
[03:55.57]'Cause I left behind the home that you made me
